WEBVTT

00:31.664 --> 00:33.600
This medicine's pain
cuts deep into the bones.

00:34.624 --> 00:36.730
Your Highness,
you must endure it a little longer.

01:32.620 --> 01:35.024
Your Highness, you still need
to stay in the medicinal bath

01:35.050 --> 01:36.150
and soak for another hour.

01:39.424 --> 01:41.136
Thank you for your trouble, Yunhuai.

01:47.000 --> 01:48.070
You seem

01:48.560 --> 01:49.680
to be different from before.

01:55.310 --> 01:56.230
How so?

01:58.304 --> 02:00.920
You have been afflicted
by a strange poison since childhood.

02:00.920 --> 02:02.390
It has been incurable for a long time.

02:02.560 --> 02:04.480
Although you sought medical treatment,

02:05.200 --> 02:08.190
you had a carefree attitude, as if
you were indifferent to life and death.

02:09.190 --> 02:10.030
You often said

02:10.590 --> 02:12.080
that the remaining five or six years

02:12.384 --> 02:14.352
were enough to find the person
who poisoned you.

02:14.630 --> 02:15.310
After that,

02:15.910 --> 02:17.190
you would travel the world

02:17.280 --> 02:18.448
with no set date of return.

02:18.910 --> 02:20.030
But today,

02:20.430 --> 02:21.590
you are so eager to be cured.

02:23.120 --> 02:25.056
This is the first time
I've seen you like this.

02:26.120 --> 02:28.280
If not for your skilled treatment
back then,

02:29.808 --> 02:31.710
I certainly wouldn't have lived
to this day.

02:32.750 --> 02:33.840
Every treatment

02:33.960 --> 02:36.640
feels like my bones are being scraped
and my flesh is being cut.

02:37.280 --> 02:39.310
You always praise me for my strong will,

02:39.910 --> 02:41.030
but every time,

02:43.000 --> 02:44.840
the pain is so unbearable

02:46.560 --> 02:48.030
that I want to end my own life.

02:48.280 --> 02:48.840
Your Highness,

02:49.470 --> 02:50.680
you must not think that way.

02:52.030 --> 02:53.030
But now,

02:55.190 --> 02:57.190
I truly want to live a little longer.

03:00.280 --> 03:01.080
I've discovered

03:03.056 --> 03:05.400
that there are indeed some things
I haven't experienced

03:07.910 --> 03:09.560
that I yearn for.

04:33.220 --> 04:34.048
=Blossoms of Power=

04:34.048 --> 04:36.820
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

04:36.900 --> 04:39.860
=Episode 6=

05:06.390 --> 05:07.000
Your Highness.

05:07.270 --> 05:08.430
While on patrol,

05:08.560 --> 05:09.750
I intercepted a secret letter.

05:32.920 --> 05:33.720
Your Highness,

05:34.160 --> 05:35.430
after you and the Crown Prince

05:35.430 --> 05:37.190
finished viewing
the Starvine Moss together,

05:37.190 --> 05:40.040
you can still read a book here
so calmly.

05:40.528 --> 05:43.120
Did you get to know the Crown Prince
a little better this time?

05:46.240 --> 05:47.070
He's very good.

05:48.120 --> 05:49.040
So good

05:49.488 --> 05:51.232
that it makes me even more guarded.

05:55.310 --> 05:56.600
How did you get so soaked?

05:56.688 --> 05:58.240
They say kittens are afraid of water,

05:58.368 --> 05:59.430
but this one is different.

05:59.488 --> 06:01.240
The harder it rains,
the more it runs outside.

06:01.480 --> 06:02.750
Find a cloth to dry it off.

06:04.160 --> 06:04.800
I'll go get one.

06:08.120 --> 06:08.600
Come.

06:16.870 --> 06:17.560
Your Highness,

06:17.920 --> 06:19.270
Prince Lie is here to see you.

06:19.648 --> 06:20.608
I won't see him.

06:21.560 --> 06:22.240
He said

06:22.240 --> 06:24.448
you will definitely change your mind
after seeing this.

06:31.460 --> 06:33.420
(Military Seal)

06:34.040 --> 06:35.190
The Anxi defense map?

06:35.216 --> 06:36.560
This map is a core military secret

06:36.560 --> 06:38.630
that the Duke of Wei's Manor
has guarded for generations.

06:38.640 --> 06:41.350
It marks the strengths and weaknesses
of the seven defense lines in northwest,

06:41.360 --> 06:43.070
the troop deployments
in sixteen fortresses,

06:43.430 --> 06:45.190
as well as hidden granaries
and water sources.

06:48.000 --> 06:49.800
If this map were to fall
into enemy hands,

06:50.832 --> 06:53.800
it would be like completely exposing
the vital points of northwest frontier.

06:53.800 --> 06:55.070
You are right.

06:55.232 --> 06:57.070
Even if this map doesn't fall
into enemy hands,

06:57.120 --> 06:58.672
the crime of losing it alone is severe.

06:58.704 --> 06:59.880
For losing a national treasure,

06:59.888 --> 07:01.510
the responsible official
will be executed by waist-chopping,

07:01.510 --> 07:03.136
and three generations of their family
will be exiled 1,500 km.

07:03.160 --> 07:05.056
If this matter were
to reach the imperial court,

07:05.104 --> 07:05.750
I'm afraid

07:06.480 --> 07:08.040
it would be a devastating disaster

07:08.920 --> 07:10.160
for our Duke of Wei's Manor.

07:11.950 --> 07:12.864
(A defense map)

07:12.880 --> 07:14.630
(is enough to stir up turmoil
in the court.)

07:14.640 --> 07:16.768
(It could bring eternal damnation
upon the Shen family.)

07:16.800 --> 07:18.240
(I must protect northwest)

07:18.510 --> 07:19.680
(in order to protect myself.)

07:19.680 --> 07:21.360
Will you see Prince Lie, Your Highness?

07:21.480 --> 07:22.040
No.

07:22.160 --> 07:22.830
Your Highness.

07:23.680 --> 07:26.336
Prince Lie doesn't know
if this map is real or fake right now.

07:26.430 --> 07:27.360
If I see him,

07:27.560 --> 07:29.070
it will confirm that the map is real.

07:30.464 --> 07:31.480
Return it to Prince Lie.

07:32.830 --> 07:33.390
Yes.

07:34.360 --> 07:35.560
I'll write a letter to Father.

07:35.728 --> 07:37.920
In a moment, you will take
this letter to Hua Fuhai.

07:38.240 --> 07:39.390
Have him deliver it

07:39.390 --> 07:40.670
to Father as quickly as possible.

07:40.688 --> 07:41.720
Once Father knows,

07:41.830 --> 07:43.168
the defense layout will be changed.

07:43.480 --> 07:45.310
This real map will become a fake one.

07:49.120 --> 07:49.720
Your Highness.

07:49.904 --> 07:51.390
The Commandery Princess asked Hua Fuhai

07:51.390 --> 07:53.648
to deliver this letter to northwest
as quickly as possible.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.680
Ask Hua Fuhai to use a gyrfalcon

07:55.712 --> 07:57.392
to get it to northwest
as soon as possible.

07:57.424 --> 07:58.630
Aren't you going to take a look?

07:59.040 --> 07:59.680
Your Highness,

07:59.680 --> 08:00.630
this is a serious matter.

08:00.720 --> 08:01.800
About this Hua Fuhai...

08:01.920 --> 08:02.600
It's fine.

08:03.180 --> 08:06.048
In this letter, I used the secret code I
share with my father and brother.

08:06.070 --> 08:07.296
Even if he reads this letter,

08:07.300 --> 08:08.700
he won't be able to understand it.

08:08.720 --> 08:11.040
If she gave the letter to Hua Fuhai,

08:11.088 --> 08:13.424
she must be certain
that no one else can understand it.

08:15.830 --> 08:17.190
Something major must have happened.

08:17.216 --> 08:18.120
Find out what it is.

08:18.720 --> 08:19.240
Yes.

08:27.720 --> 08:29.190
Your Highness, please leave.

08:30.832 --> 08:32.832
The Commandery Princess
didn't say anything?

08:33.000 --> 08:34.510
Her Highness just said three words.

08:34.848 --> 08:35.904
"Not seeing you."

08:45.670 --> 08:47.150
(Why won't she see me?)

08:48.150 --> 08:49.670
(Could the map be a fake?)

08:55.720 --> 08:56.320
That's enough.

08:57.390 --> 08:57.870
Yes.

08:59.750 --> 09:00.960
I'll only ask you once.

09:04.270 --> 09:05.240
Where did

09:05.870 --> 09:07.080
this map come from?

09:11.840 --> 09:13.030
You're a tough one indeed.

09:49.600 --> 09:51.080
What brings you here, Your Highness?

09:52.720 --> 09:54.030
I thought about it all night.

09:55.550 --> 09:57.360
Your move of creating something
from nothing,

09:57.550 --> 09:58.790
a secret feint,

09:59.030 --> 09:59.960
was truly brilliant.

10:04.800 --> 10:06.480
If I were to give this
to my father today,

10:07.232 --> 10:08.976
what do you think
the consequences would be?

10:10.440 --> 10:12.270
You've gone to such great lengths.

10:12.790 --> 10:14.390
Can we get down to business now?

10:15.600 --> 10:16.630
Let's speak in private.

10:18.200 --> 10:18.910
Don't worry.

10:19.360 --> 10:20.360
I'm not going to eat you.

10:29.660 --> 10:34.260
(Crystal Clear as Water)

10:37.270 --> 10:38.000
Are you hungry?

10:38.670 --> 10:40.240
We didn't come here to eat.

10:40.896 --> 10:42.704
There's no need to beat around the bush.

10:42.864 --> 10:44.320
What is it that you really want?

10:47.510 --> 10:48.720
On the day of the hunt,

10:49.480 --> 10:50.390
I told you,

10:51.320 --> 10:52.150
if you marry me,

10:52.960 --> 10:54.864
I will only marry you in this lifetime.

10:55.320 --> 10:56.030
Do you remember?

10:58.270 --> 10:59.270
So,

11:00.080 --> 11:01.870
you're using that map to threaten me

11:02.510 --> 11:03.790
into agreeing to marry you?

11:03.960 --> 11:05.670
I know the map I have is real.

11:06.440 --> 11:07.630
Yesterday, you bluffed

11:07.630 --> 11:09.008
and bought yourself some time.

11:09.790 --> 11:10.630
It's a pity

11:11.120 --> 11:13.040
that northwest
is thousands of miles away.

11:15.408 --> 11:17.240
Are you trying
to use my father and brother,

11:17.360 --> 11:19.488
and the entire northwest army
to blackmail me?

11:20.496 --> 11:22.320
Then I can give you my answer right now.

11:22.720 --> 11:23.630
Impossible.

11:29.870 --> 11:30.510
Move.

11:33.960 --> 11:36.288
Your Highness, please conduct yourself
with dignity.

11:36.336 --> 11:37.088
Dignity?

11:39.270 --> 11:41.360
Didn't you know
before you even came to the capital

11:41.856 --> 11:44.120
that I have a fiery temper,
and I'm perverse and ruthless?

11:44.630 --> 11:46.240
I've never been a gentleman.

11:47.440 --> 11:50.000
I know the Duke has his heart
set on me as his ideal son-in-law.

11:51.200 --> 11:52.270
I'll ask you one more time.

11:53.584 --> 11:54.360
Will you marry me?

11:54.670 --> 11:55.440
I will not.

12:00.750 --> 12:01.790
Shen Xihe, stop right there!

12:07.030 --> 12:07.840
Could all of this

12:08.128 --> 12:10.550
be a play you've written
and directed yourself, Your Highness?

12:12.120 --> 12:12.910
What do you mean?

12:13.510 --> 12:15.840
How could the Anxi defense map,
from thousands of miles away,

12:16.440 --> 12:18.750
be intercepted by the Imperial Guard
in the imperial capital

12:18.910 --> 12:20.030
and end up in your hands?

12:24.910 --> 12:26.600
It seems you're unaware of this matter.

12:27.150 --> 12:28.510
Then it must be the work of that

12:28.910 --> 12:30.870
resourceful and decisive brother
of yours.

12:32.144 --> 12:34.240
You use such tactics
to seek my hand in marriage.

12:35.080 --> 12:36.550
If my father found out,

12:36.550 --> 12:38.180
would he still see you
as his ideal choice?

12:38.360 --> 12:39.080
Today,

12:39.296 --> 12:40.960
whatever you choose to do with this map,

12:41.120 --> 12:42.270
do as you please.

12:48.700 --> 12:51.940
(Prince Xin's Manor)

13:00.910 --> 13:01.480
Changqing,

13:02.600 --> 13:04.600
did you send someone
to steal the Anxi defense map

13:04.848 --> 13:06.000
and then put it in my hands?

13:06.790 --> 13:09.080
The Anxi defense map
concerns the safety of our borders.

13:10.000 --> 13:11.550
Although I didn't steal the map,

13:12.600 --> 13:14.080
I did arrange for someone

13:14.270 --> 13:15.320
to deliver it to you.

13:15.790 --> 13:16.360
Why?

13:17.000 --> 13:18.000
Do you know

13:18.480 --> 13:20.120
the Commander-in-Chief of Hexi,

13:20.120 --> 13:20.870
Ye Qi?

13:21.270 --> 13:22.832
Isn't he just Consort Liang's cousin?

13:23.200 --> 13:25.790
Ye Qi covets the title of Duke of Wei.

13:26.030 --> 13:28.360
He bribed a protector-general
under Shen Yueshan

13:28.870 --> 13:29.910
and stole the defense map.

13:30.960 --> 13:32.870
But our men intercepted it.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.670
Since you already intercepted the map,

13:34.688 --> 13:36.416
you should have sent it
back to northwest.

13:36.432 --> 13:38.490
Why did you let it circulate
in the imperial capital?

13:47.390 --> 13:48.840
Naturally, I wanted to help you

13:48.840 --> 13:49.960
win the one you love.

13:50.670 --> 13:52.480
I've said it before.
I don't need your help.

13:52.600 --> 13:54.480
I will pursue the one I love myself.

13:54.688 --> 13:56.000
Relying on schemes and tricks

13:56.032 --> 13:57.168
is not what I call sincerity.

13:57.390 --> 13:58.670
What can be seen

13:59.600 --> 14:01.080
is called sincerity.

14:02.200 --> 14:03.150
What cannot be seen

14:03.840 --> 14:04.910
is called unrequited love.

14:06.390 --> 14:06.910
By the way,

14:07.630 --> 14:09.550
with your straightforward personality,

14:11.200 --> 14:13.080
how did you figure out I was behind it?

14:15.952 --> 14:17.744
I met with Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

14:18.510 --> 14:19.600
She was the one who guessed

14:19.840 --> 14:21.630
that you were behind all of this.

14:26.030 --> 14:27.750
I've never met her before.

14:29.840 --> 14:32.360
How does she understand
my thoughts so well?

14:33.120 --> 14:34.910
Last time,
my plan to retrieve the Rouge Ledger

14:34.910 --> 14:36.270
was completely seen through by her.

14:36.630 --> 14:38.030
It's the same this time.

14:58.320 --> 14:59.670
She easily...

15:02.200 --> 15:03.630
saw right through me.

15:08.750 --> 15:09.750
(Taiji Hall)
Recently,

15:09.750 --> 15:11.600
rumors have been spreading
throughout the court,

15:11.720 --> 15:12.960
saying that Shen Yueshan

15:13.360 --> 15:15.270
has lost the Anxi defense map.

15:15.600 --> 15:16.630
My dear ministers,

15:18.270 --> 15:19.870
have you heard of this?

15:26.510 --> 15:28.480
I have heard something of it.

15:28.840 --> 15:29.510
Your Majesty,

15:29.870 --> 15:32.360
the defense map is of vital importance
to the state.

15:33.120 --> 15:34.440
This is a serious matter.

15:35.120 --> 15:37.390
Although the rumors are hard to verify,

15:37.480 --> 15:38.960
there's no smoke without fire.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.240
I believe

15:40.240 --> 15:42.670
we should immediately summon
Shen Yueshan to the capital

15:43.200 --> 15:44.240
to give an explanation.

15:48.750 --> 15:50.870
I believe that is absolutely
out of the question.

15:52.150 --> 15:54.270
If someone is intentionally
creating a diversion

15:54.630 --> 15:56.000
to lure the tiger from the mountain,

15:56.080 --> 15:58.150
and northwest is attacked

15:58.480 --> 16:00.080
with no one there to command,

16:00.390 --> 16:02.910
what shall we do then?

16:02.910 --> 16:03.790
Indeed.

16:03.790 --> 16:05.630
Northwest cannot be left unguarded.

16:06.120 --> 16:08.120
But the Duke of Wei is indeed a suspect.

16:08.240 --> 16:10.510
What should be done in this situation?

16:13.630 --> 16:15.540
(Dong Biquan, Minister of Revenue)
Your Majesty,

16:15.550 --> 16:17.510
I have received reliable information

16:17.720 --> 16:19.120
that the Anxi defense map

16:19.120 --> 16:21.030
is in the hands of Prince Lie.

16:23.480 --> 16:24.480
Changying,

16:26.510 --> 16:27.840
is this true?

16:33.440 --> 16:34.480
Reporting to Your Majesty,

16:34.928 --> 16:36.200
I do not know where Minister Dong

16:36.200 --> 16:38.150
heard such a ridiculous rumor.

16:38.720 --> 16:40.440
If the defense map were
in my possession,

16:40.670 --> 16:42.480
I would have presented it
to you immediately.

16:44.550 --> 16:46.840
The Imperial Guard
has never intercepted any spy,

16:47.240 --> 16:48.750
nor has Prince Lie

16:48.750 --> 16:50.270
tortured anyone in prison.

16:50.480 --> 16:51.910
Since you are so certain,

16:52.416 --> 16:53.720
why not present your evidence?

16:53.840 --> 16:55.080
I am willing to face him.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.000
Changying,

16:59.390 --> 17:00.670
I ask you again.

17:01.270 --> 17:03.670
Did you really not intercept
the defense map?

17:04.176 --> 17:05.984
Reporting to Your Majesty,

17:06.240 --> 17:06.790
I did not.

17:06.960 --> 17:07.550
Good.

17:08.200 --> 17:09.590
Prince Lie said he did not.

17:09.830 --> 17:11.110
Then he did not.

17:11.550 --> 17:14.200
My ministers,
there is no need to chase shadows.

17:14.928 --> 17:16.160
Dispatch someone immediately

17:16.160 --> 17:17.240
to northwest

17:17.350 --> 17:18.830
to investigate this matter thoroughly.

17:18.830 --> 17:19.590
I trust

17:20.000 --> 17:22.350
there will be a conclusion soon.

17:24.580 --> 17:30.900
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

17:35.550 --> 17:36.110
Your Highness,

17:36.192 --> 17:37.480
news has arrived from northwest.

17:37.600 --> 17:39.968
The defense map has been safely returned
to Shen Yueshan.

18:00.880 --> 18:03.350
Prince Lie not only
stopped pressuring you,

18:03.424 --> 18:06.192
but also protected northwest
at the risk of deceiving His Majesty.

18:06.270 --> 18:08.480
His feelings for you are truly deep.

18:08.790 --> 18:09.880
Although he is unruly,

18:11.510 --> 18:13.160
he is ultimately good-natured.

18:15.750 --> 18:17.510
But as long as
the map thief isn't caught,

18:18.030 --> 18:19.160
the crisis in northwest

18:19.680 --> 18:21.070
will not end.

18:24.310 --> 18:24.920
Your Highness,

18:25.480 --> 18:26.720
Hua Fuhai sent a secret letter.

18:29.240 --> 18:29.880
He says

18:30.160 --> 18:31.960
he is greatly honored to have your trust

18:32.400 --> 18:34.200
and is willing to serve you loyally.

18:36.350 --> 18:38.310
Commander-in-Chief of Hexi?

18:39.070 --> 18:41.070
Ye Qi, Commander-in-Chief of Hexi.

18:42.528 --> 18:44.608
He has been in charge of Liangzhou
for over a decade

18:44.832 --> 18:46.590
and knows northwest
like the back of his hand.

18:47.310 --> 18:48.550
With the defense map lost,

18:49.070 --> 18:50.830
if His Majesty holds
the Duke accountable,

18:51.008 --> 18:53.584
he is the most likely person
to take over the northwest Army.

18:53.790 --> 18:54.790
I see.

18:56.680 --> 18:58.240
Hua Fuhai is trying to tell me

18:59.392 --> 19:01.200
that the map thief
is one of Ye Qi's men.

19:02.000 --> 19:04.200
Mo Yuan, send a message
to Father immediately.

19:04.210 --> 19:05.570
He must investigate this thoroughly.

19:05.584 --> 19:05.960
Yes.

19:08.272 --> 19:09.830
The court discussed it this morning,

19:10.440 --> 19:12.070
and we only heard the news at lunch.

19:13.270 --> 19:15.200
Yet Hua Fuhai
has already sent us the answer.

19:21.030 --> 19:22.680
It must be that Tagara Incense

19:22.790 --> 19:24.310
that made Hua Fuhai act this way.

19:24.830 --> 19:26.510
It seems he has everything
under control.

19:30.000 --> 19:30.680
Your Highness,

19:30.960 --> 19:31.920
don't you think

19:31.920 --> 19:33.680
we're always
at a disadvantage like this?

19:35.310 --> 19:35.960
Go on.

19:36.680 --> 19:37.550
Regarding Ye Qi,

19:37.584 --> 19:39.760
you leaked the
information to the Commandery Princess.

19:40.270 --> 19:41.310
But on the surface,

19:41.550 --> 19:43.480
it looks like Prince Lie saved her

19:43.480 --> 19:44.510
and protected northwest.

19:44.750 --> 19:45.510
This way,

19:45.640 --> 19:47.590
she will surely be more moved,

19:47.680 --> 19:49.640
and the Duke will favor him even more.

19:51.510 --> 19:52.880
Changying has no chance.

19:55.720 --> 19:57.270
Your Highness, why are you so certain?

19:58.680 --> 20:00.640
Changqing and Changying
share a deep bond.

20:01.400 --> 20:03.720
The Duke thinks
Changqing is exceptionally talented

20:03.808 --> 20:05.360
and most likely to inherit the throne.

20:06.200 --> 20:08.790
Then, Changying would be second
only to one and above all others.

20:08.848 --> 20:11.568
The Commandery Princess would also
avoid the conflicts of the harem.

20:11.640 --> 20:12.680
The Duke

20:12.680 --> 20:14.240
has chosen the best path

20:14.480 --> 20:16.030
for his precious daughter.

20:19.240 --> 20:20.440
It's just a pity

20:21.110 --> 20:22.550
that to achieve his goal,

20:22.896 --> 20:25.424
Changqing would actually use
the defense map to threaten her.

20:25.680 --> 20:26.270
Tian Yuan,

20:26.720 --> 20:27.480
give the order.

20:27.880 --> 20:29.400
Find a way to let the Duke know

20:29.400 --> 20:31.270
that the Commandery Princess
was threatened.

20:32.070 --> 20:32.480
Yes.

20:32.592 --> 20:33.952
You are wise, Your Highness.

20:36.720 --> 20:37.240
By the way,

20:38.830 --> 20:40.110
didn't Zhao Zhenghao say

20:40.510 --> 20:42.720
he already had a lead
on the source of the strange poison?

20:42.720 --> 20:43.880
What's the progress now?

20:43.890 --> 20:46.880
Recently, a foreign merchant from the
Western Regions did come to the capital.

20:46.900 --> 20:48.430
He specializes in selling illicit drugs,

20:48.440 --> 20:50.510
including many strange poisons.

20:51.510 --> 20:52.350
However,

20:52.510 --> 20:53.920
this person is cunning

20:54.200 --> 20:55.160
and difficult to find.

20:55.504 --> 20:57.856
Vice Minister Cui is already
investigating in secret.

21:18.640 --> 21:19.790
Right under the Emperor's nose,

21:19.790 --> 21:22.070
someone dares to openly smuggle drugs!

21:22.680 --> 21:23.480
Investigate it!

21:23.880 --> 21:24.510
- Yes.
- Yes.

21:27.720 --> 21:28.720
The Imperial Guard?

21:29.310 --> 21:30.310
What are you doing here?

21:30.720 --> 21:33.070
It seems we are quite fated.

21:35.520 --> 21:37.872
We even run into each other
while investigating a case.

21:39.888 --> 21:41.270
What case are you investigating?

21:41.312 --> 21:43.030
A foreign merchant
from the Western Regions

21:43.030 --> 21:44.790
who has two lives on his hands
from robbery and murder.

21:44.800 --> 21:45.850
And you, Vice Minister Cui?

21:45.936 --> 21:46.960
It's none of your business.

21:48.680 --> 21:50.350
This foreign merchant is truly cunning

21:50.350 --> 21:51.640
and meticulous in his actions.

21:51.720 --> 21:54.160
But he can't escape
his weakness for ladies.

21:54.680 --> 21:56.270
My informant told me

21:56.590 --> 21:58.550
he's going to a tavern by the river
for some fun.

21:59.640 --> 22:01.070
If you're willing, Vice Minister Cui,

22:02.830 --> 22:04.160
you can join me in capturing him.

22:13.000 --> 22:14.240
Long time no see.

22:14.550 --> 22:15.350
Indeed.

22:15.750 --> 22:16.960
Come, come, have a seat inside.

22:16.960 --> 22:18.224
Let me accompany you inside.

22:51.000 --> 22:52.200
Why are you staring at me?

22:52.464 --> 22:54.624
I'm looking at the four big words
on your forehead,

22:54.720 --> 22:56.270
"I am an officer."

23:01.000 --> 23:02.830
You don't look like a patron at all.

23:02.920 --> 23:05.790
No songstress or drinking. You might
as well just announce to the world

23:05.790 --> 23:07.110
that we're here to arrest someone.

23:07.110 --> 23:08.200
You were the one who told me

23:08.200 --> 23:09.030
that after staking this place out
for days,

23:09.030 --> 23:10.400
the foreign merchant
would definitely show up today.

23:10.420 --> 23:11.872
Otherwise, why would I be with you...

23:13.200 --> 23:14.200
in a place like this?

23:17.400 --> 23:19.640
You say that
as if it's your first time here.

23:24.000 --> 23:25.270
It really is your first time?

23:28.880 --> 23:31.000
The only pure and innocent man
in the world.

23:31.072 --> 23:32.030
What's so hard about it?

23:32.030 --> 23:32.920
I'll just teach you.

23:34.000 --> 23:34.750
Don't touch me.

23:35.030 --> 23:36.070
Don't be ungrateful.

23:36.176 --> 23:37.872
I'm teaching you
how to get into character.

23:38.030 --> 23:39.310
You can just tell me.

23:42.590 --> 23:43.480
Loosen your clothes.

23:49.680 --> 23:51.240
A grown man being so indecisive.

23:51.240 --> 23:52.400
Keep your hands to yourself.

23:53.160 --> 23:54.070
I know him.

23:54.070 --> 23:55.350
Young Master Cui.

23:55.350 --> 23:56.240
Yes, that's him.

23:56.240 --> 23:57.680
It's him. It's definitely him.

23:58.144 --> 23:58.752
Let's go.

23:58.760 --> 24:00.960
If someone recognizes you,
your reputation will be ruined.

24:00.960 --> 24:02.544
Where do we go?
They've blocked the door.

24:02.550 --> 24:03.160
Go that way.

24:03.160 --> 24:03.920
Get up.

24:04.160 --> 24:04.790
Hurry, let's go.

24:05.152 --> 24:06.690
- Young Master Cui!
- Young Master Cui!

24:06.880 --> 24:08.030
You have the wrong person.

24:10.000 --> 24:11.400
They jumped into the river?

24:16.510 --> 24:17.590
Good thing we ran fast.

24:17.680 --> 24:19.160
It's okay. We're fine now. Here.

24:23.110 --> 24:23.640
Wait.

24:23.830 --> 24:24.640
Don't worry.

24:26.310 --> 24:27.510
Next time I set a trap,

24:27.584 --> 24:29.510
we'll definitely catch
that foreign merchant.

24:33.790 --> 24:34.310
Hold on.

24:38.400 --> 24:40.624
Why are you just taking
someone else's things?

24:41.184 --> 24:42.590
An official is investigating a case.

24:42.600 --> 24:44.230
I'm just commandeering
a piece of clothing.

24:44.240 --> 24:45.550
Why make such a big deal out of it?

24:45.550 --> 24:47.000
Do not commit an evil act,
no matter how small.

24:47.000 --> 24:48.640
As a court official,
you knowingly broke the law

24:48.640 --> 24:49.550
and you show no remorse.

24:49.904 --> 24:51.070
This is truly unreasonable.

24:51.680 --> 24:52.440
I'll take my leave.

25:03.480 --> 25:04.920
I was afraid you'd catch a cold.

25:04.920 --> 25:05.550
Put it on.

25:12.736 --> 25:13.808
Then you should also...

25:20.000 --> 25:20.720
Farewell.

25:50.500 --> 25:53.340
(Xu Qing, Abbot of Fahua Temple)

25:54.440 --> 25:57.750
Your Highness, the Jati flower incense
blended by you

25:57.750 --> 26:00.750
is pure, rich, and elegant.
It's truly extraordinary.

26:01.030 --> 26:05.270
We have been trying to create a superior
Buddhist incense without success.

26:07.000 --> 26:09.510
Thank you, Your Highness,
for lending your aid.

26:10.200 --> 26:11.200
You flatter me, Master.

26:11.790 --> 26:13.480
I am willing to do my part.

27:14.240 --> 27:16.920
Greetings, Your Highness.

27:17.240 --> 27:18.240
Master, may I ask,

27:19.120 --> 27:21.088
did Commandery Princess Zhaoning
come here today

27:21.520 --> 27:23.584
to specifically blend
the Jati flower incense

27:24.110 --> 27:25.550
for the Buddha statue?

27:28.070 --> 27:31.270
The last time the Empress Dowager
brought Her Highness to offer incense,

27:32.030 --> 27:34.640
it coincided with our temple's attempt
to blend this incense.

27:35.270 --> 27:37.350
However, we could not
get the method right.

27:38.160 --> 27:40.200
We asked Her Highness for some guidance.

27:40.480 --> 27:42.480
The fragrance turned out to be superior.

27:43.310 --> 27:44.400
Therefore, today,

27:44.590 --> 27:46.510
we invited Her Highness again.

27:47.000 --> 27:48.160
So you're saying

27:49.240 --> 27:50.350
Commandery Princess Zhaoning

27:51.110 --> 27:52.440
is an expert in incense making?

27:52.640 --> 27:54.880
Right now,
not just in the entire imperial capital,

27:56.000 --> 27:59.070
but even throughout all of Daxing,
it would be hard to find her equal.

27:59.720 --> 28:02.750
There are extraordinary people
in this world, uniquely gifted.

28:03.640 --> 28:05.880
Incense making requires
a certain spiritual gift.

28:07.310 --> 28:09.550
A natural talent like Her Highness's...

28:10.240 --> 28:13.720
I have only ever seen it
in one other person in my entire life.

28:14.680 --> 28:15.920
Are you referring to

28:17.830 --> 28:18.920
my princess consort?

28:20.440 --> 28:22.200
Precisely, it's your princess consort.

28:23.440 --> 28:25.070
It's strange, now that you mention it.

28:25.640 --> 28:28.790
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
has come a long way from northwest,

28:29.270 --> 28:31.240
but her incense-blending technique

28:31.510 --> 28:34.790
is identical to that
of the Prince Xin's Consort.

28:35.000 --> 28:36.590
There's not the slightest difference.

29:16.000 --> 29:18.070
Your Highness,
what do you think of this piece?

29:51.030 --> 29:52.000
Qingqing.

29:53.720 --> 29:54.920
Someone like you,

29:57.030 --> 29:58.830
a proper and elegant lady,

29:59.550 --> 30:01.000
could never do something

30:05.030 --> 30:06.790
so free-spirited and unrestrained.

30:12.350 --> 30:13.550
She is not you.

30:35.880 --> 30:36.480
Over there.

30:38.496 --> 30:40.320
Greetings, Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

30:48.160 --> 30:50.304
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

30:51.104 --> 30:53.350
I was at the temple today
to pay respects to my late wife.

30:53.728 --> 30:54.920
I happened to run into you.

30:55.440 --> 30:56.880
May I have a word with you in private?

30:58.160 --> 31:00.240
What is it you wish to discuss,
Your Highness?

31:00.400 --> 31:01.550
You can speak freely here.

31:02.510 --> 31:03.590
A few days ago,

31:04.510 --> 31:07.000
His Majesty gathered all the princes
at the hunting grounds

31:07.350 --> 31:08.920
to profess their feelings for you.

31:09.480 --> 31:11.240
At the time, you did not make a choice.

31:11.880 --> 31:12.680
Changying

31:12.960 --> 31:14.510
is my only full brother.

31:14.544 --> 31:15.960
I would like to, on his behalf,

31:16.512 --> 31:18.400
ask for your hand in marriage once more.

31:18.680 --> 31:19.830
Ask on his behalf?

31:20.192 --> 31:22.480
Although Changying can be
a bit impatient and arrogant,

31:22.480 --> 31:25.070
he is a sincere person
with a resolute heart.

31:25.790 --> 31:27.400
His feelings for you are genuine.

31:27.440 --> 31:29.056
That is why I have the audacity to ask.

31:29.550 --> 31:30.720
If you agree,

31:30.768 --> 31:32.320
Changying will,
for the rest of his life,

31:32.480 --> 31:33.480
never love another.

31:34.000 --> 31:36.110
If we can unite our families
through marriage,

31:36.208 --> 31:38.200
then regarding the future situation
in northwest,

31:38.550 --> 31:40.310
whatever you and Duke Wei desire,

31:40.550 --> 31:41.920
I, Changqing, will also

31:42.032 --> 31:43.712
do my utmost to ensure it happens.

31:51.312 --> 31:53.504
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

31:54.960 --> 31:55.550
At ease.

31:56.270 --> 31:57.550
Your Highness,

31:58.550 --> 31:59.790
why are you at Fahua Temple?

32:01.920 --> 32:04.270
I heard the ginkgo trees
at Fahua Temple are quite lovely.

32:04.550 --> 32:05.350
I came specially

32:05.720 --> 32:06.400
to see for myself.

32:11.504 --> 32:13.960
Why are you collecting ginkgo leaves,
Commandery Princess?

32:14.440 --> 32:15.270
What are they for?

32:15.360 --> 32:16.550
To make a medicinal pillow

32:16.880 --> 32:17.790
to help with sleep.

32:19.480 --> 32:20.070
Really?

32:20.736 --> 32:22.480
I often have trouble sleeping at night.

32:22.590 --> 32:23.480
I wonder if you

32:23.480 --> 32:24.920
could share the method with me.

32:25.880 --> 32:27.680
In that case, I will make one for you.

32:29.070 --> 32:29.880
Thank you.

32:33.880 --> 32:34.550
What?

32:35.920 --> 32:37.160
Do you want one, too?

32:37.960 --> 32:39.750
After I get the method from her,

32:39.880 --> 32:41.830
I'll make one for you with my own hands.

32:44.680 --> 32:46.550
You are frail.
I wouldn't dare trouble you.

32:46.920 --> 32:47.960
You should rest well.

32:48.360 --> 32:49.440
You're very considerate.

32:49.550 --> 32:51.480
But this is something I can manage.

32:52.400 --> 32:54.070
Please, take your time, Your Highnesses.

32:54.310 --> 32:55.310
It's getting late.

32:55.920 --> 32:57.160
I should be returning home.

33:06.384 --> 33:08.576
Enjoy your stroll in the garden,
Your Highness.

33:08.790 --> 33:09.920
I shall take my leave as well.

33:22.070 --> 33:22.720
Tian Yuan.

33:23.632 --> 33:25.200
Have someone sort through these leaves,

33:25.750 --> 33:26.790
pick out the best ones,

33:26.864 --> 33:28.544
and give them
to the Commandery Princess.

33:29.110 --> 33:29.550
Yes.

33:49.160 --> 33:49.920
Guards.

33:49.920 --> 33:53.140
(Boundless Compassion, Pure Inaction)

33:53.750 --> 33:54.680
Your Highness.

33:54.992 --> 33:57.184
Investigate
Commandery Princess Zhaoning thoroughly.

33:57.680 --> 33:59.270
Everything related to her,

34:00.720 --> 34:02.310
every single detail,

34:02.784 --> 34:04.544
no matter how minor,
must not be overlooked.

34:05.200 --> 34:05.590
Yes.

34:12.740 --> 34:16.580
(East Palace)

34:17.920 --> 34:18.480
Your Highness,

34:18.528 --> 34:19.880
the Commandery Princess was so quick

34:19.880 --> 34:20.880
to send the pillow over.

34:20.880 --> 34:22.360
And she made it herself.

34:22.710 --> 34:23.320
Tian Yuan,

34:23.760 --> 34:24.760
don't you think

34:25.110 --> 34:26.320
that she has been

34:27.440 --> 34:28.480
a bit closer to me lately?

34:28.840 --> 34:30.550
More than just a bit closer.

34:30.760 --> 34:32.030
It's a huge step forward.

34:32.670 --> 34:35.312
The way she looks at you, there's
a hint of tenderness in her eyes.

34:35.376 --> 34:36.960
This is unprecedented.

34:37.110 --> 34:38.670
It's a look she reserves only for you.

34:43.880 --> 34:44.440
Your Highness,

34:44.976 --> 34:46.832
regarding the case
of the Anxi defense map,

34:47.000 --> 34:48.784
Duke Wei started his investigation
with Ye Qi

34:48.816 --> 34:51.260
and has clarified many suspicious points
and gathered evidence.

34:51.296 --> 34:53.344
He sent men to report each finding
to His Majesty.

34:53.392 --> 34:54.630
His Majesty was very displeased.

34:54.720 --> 34:55.760
During the court session,

34:55.872 --> 34:57.800
in front of all the civil
and military officials,

34:57.840 --> 35:00.000
he reprimanded Ye Qi
for his malicious intentions.

35:00.440 --> 35:01.630
To show his loyalty,

35:01.696 --> 35:02.800
Ye Qi kowtowed on the floor

35:02.800 --> 35:04.000
until his head was bleeding,

35:04.440 --> 35:05.670
solemnly vowing

35:06.110 --> 35:07.920
that the matter had nothing
to do with him.

35:08.360 --> 35:09.840
How did Father deal with him?

35:10.000 --> 35:11.024
His Majesty sentenced Ye Qi

35:11.056 --> 35:13.020
to exile in Tongzhou.
He's to be a slave for life.

35:13.632 --> 35:15.920
He's forbidden
from entering the capital forever.

35:15.920 --> 35:16.960
He brought it upon himself.

35:17.710 --> 35:18.710
With Ye Qi's downfall,

35:19.000 --> 35:21.710
the lucrative position
of Commander-in-Chief of Hexi is vacant.

35:22.070 --> 35:23.280
At court tomorrow,

35:23.440 --> 35:25.110
there will surely be an endless argument

35:25.480 --> 35:26.800
over who will replace him.

35:27.920 --> 35:29.712
Your Highness, what are your plans?

35:35.590 --> 35:37.400
Let Xiao Changqing's man take it.

35:37.800 --> 35:39.230
The Commander-in-Chief of Hexi

35:39.230 --> 35:40.480
controls the northwest corridor.

35:40.624 --> 35:43.000
Prince Xin has had his eye
on this position for a long time.

35:43.590 --> 35:44.280
In the future,

35:44.590 --> 35:47.070
he can also help Prince Lie
pursue the Commandery Princess.

35:51.150 --> 35:52.030
In this matter,

35:52.360 --> 35:54.070
Changqing and Changying
benefit the most.

35:54.112 --> 35:55.350
The Duke of Wei will surely think

35:55.360 --> 35:57.030
that they were the ones
pulling the strings.

35:59.920 --> 36:02.800
Changying is already deeply in love
with the Commandery Princess.

36:03.190 --> 36:05.150
And Changying,
even while mourning his late wife,

36:05.150 --> 36:06.590
didn't forget to propose marriage.

36:07.632 --> 36:09.920
Since they're so persistent
about the Commandery Princess,

36:10.360 --> 36:12.480
we might as well crush
their foolish hopes completely.

36:12.880 --> 36:14.400
(Taiji Hall)
By His Majesty's decree.

36:14.590 --> 36:16.670
The bandit infestation in Fengzhou
has been eradicated,

36:16.670 --> 36:18.688
and the people's livelihood
has been stabilized.

36:18.752 --> 36:21.968
General Rong Ce of Anbei
deserves the highest merit.

36:22.070 --> 36:26.000
Effective immediately, he is reassigned
as Commander-in-Chief of Hexi.

36:26.150 --> 36:27.800
Thus it is decreed.

36:30.760 --> 36:32.030
The one who was just promoted

36:32.030 --> 36:33.880
is your maternal uncle, isn't he?

36:34.230 --> 36:37.190
Noble Consort Rong's elder brother
was enfeoffed as the Duke of Ying.

36:37.360 --> 36:40.630
Now, her younger brother has been
promoted to Commander-in-Chief of Hexi.

36:40.630 --> 36:42.070
Truly two heroes from one family.

36:42.070 --> 36:43.280
This is cause for celebration.

36:44.190 --> 36:46.760
My humble congratulations
to you two princes.

36:47.072 --> 36:49.424
This bandit problem
that has been going on for half a year

36:49.480 --> 36:52.480
happened to coincide with the vacancy
of Commander-in-Chief of Hexi position.

36:52.490 --> 36:54.176
And it just so happened
to be resolved then.

36:54.224 --> 36:55.710
What timely news.

36:56.480 --> 36:57.440
Very timely.

36:57.920 --> 36:59.550
Perhaps a month ago,

36:59.550 --> 37:01.400
or even longer,
it was already taken care of.

37:02.000 --> 37:04.480
They were just waiting
for the right time to report it.

37:04.480 --> 37:05.320
Exactly.

37:08.110 --> 37:09.440
I shall take my leave.

37:10.280 --> 37:11.800
Minister Hu, wait for me.

37:19.200 --> 37:20.688
Regarding the bandit suppression,

37:20.736 --> 37:22.230
I did not dare to report it rashly.

37:22.880 --> 37:25.030
I intended to send a message
to Your Highness

37:25.030 --> 37:26.070
and await your decision.

37:26.080 --> 37:27.696
Who would have known
that the royal uncle

37:27.728 --> 37:29.216
would submit a memorial behind my back?

37:29.264 --> 37:31.100
It was my failure
to handle the matter properly.

37:31.110 --> 37:32.670
I ask for Your Highness's punishment.

37:34.400 --> 37:35.670
This has nothing to do with you.

37:36.760 --> 37:37.480
You may leave.

37:38.070 --> 37:38.550
Yes.

37:42.000 --> 37:42.550
Changqing.

37:43.000 --> 37:44.670
With our uncle now in the position

37:45.320 --> 37:47.190
of Commander-in-Chief of Hexi,

37:47.590 --> 37:49.670
we have made many enemies at court.

37:50.110 --> 37:51.960
Furthermore, Shen Yueshan will suspect

37:52.840 --> 37:54.190
that we were the masterminds.

37:54.720 --> 37:57.504
This will affect your marriage
to Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

37:58.000 --> 37:58.960
All of this

38:00.760 --> 38:02.030
seems like a coincidence,

38:03.880 --> 38:05.230
but it's actually very strange.

38:07.888 --> 38:09.510
There must be someone behind the scenes,

38:10.230 --> 38:11.440
secretly manipulating things.

38:13.440 --> 38:15.360
Given Xiao Changqing's
cunning and schemes,

38:15.550 --> 38:17.030
if he were behind this,

38:17.440 --> 38:19.230
he would have done it
without anyone noticing.

38:20.230 --> 38:22.280
Even if he wanted
to install his own man,

38:22.550 --> 38:23.840
it wouldn't be this one,

38:23.840 --> 38:25.510
an uncle
with such obvious nepotistic ties.

38:26.480 --> 38:27.800
Looking at the whole situation,

38:28.510 --> 38:30.360
not only did he not gain any advantage,

38:30.784 --> 38:33.120
but he has instead attracted a lot
of jealousy and resentment.

38:33.480 --> 38:35.230
He's become a clear target for everyone.

38:35.840 --> 38:36.880
Your Highness, you mean

38:37.230 --> 38:39.360
someone is secretly
targeting the two brothers?

38:42.960 --> 38:44.880
The General of Anbei position
vacated by Rong Ce,

38:45.000 --> 38:46.030
who filled it?

38:47.024 --> 38:50.000
Someone was transferred from
the Imperial Guard to fill the vacancy.

38:50.352 --> 38:52.624
Then the position that opened up
in the Imperial Guard,

38:52.656 --> 38:53.744
who filled that?

38:54.440 --> 38:55.360
The Embroidered Envoy.

39:01.670 --> 39:03.000
Could it be

39:03.280 --> 39:04.710
that Tagara Incense again?

39:07.800 --> 39:09.550
He can silently

39:10.030 --> 39:11.710
infiltrate the Emperor's most rigorous

39:11.880 --> 39:13.360
and tight-knit circle of power.

39:14.480 --> 39:16.670
And he's also an enemy
of the Xiao Changqing brothers.

39:17.670 --> 39:18.800
Could it be...

39:20.752 --> 39:22.360
He is a member of the royal family?

39:35.216 --> 39:36.480
Reporting to Young Master Bu.

39:36.510 --> 39:38.544
I've already notified
all the Shunan merchant guilds.

39:38.592 --> 39:40.760
Once that foreign merchant
selling illicit drugs appears,

39:40.760 --> 39:42.070
he will be watched closely.

39:42.070 --> 39:42.760
I guarantee

39:43.000 --> 39:44.070
he'll have nowhere to run.

39:44.710 --> 39:46.360
He entered from the Shunan border

39:46.370 --> 39:48.130
and is doing business
in the imperial capital.

39:48.150 --> 39:50.180
He definitely can't avoid
the Shunan merchant guilds.

39:50.360 --> 39:51.960
You're an important figure
in the guilds.

39:52.030 --> 39:53.230
Don't let me down.

39:59.072 --> 40:00.550
- Young Master Bu.
- Young Master Bu.

40:00.576 --> 40:01.440
Young Master.

40:01.630 --> 40:02.590
Young Master.

40:03.110 --> 40:04.110
Young Master.

40:04.160 --> 40:05.824
It's been so long since your last visit.

40:05.872 --> 40:06.960
I thought

40:06.960 --> 40:08.550
you had forgotten about me.

40:11.360 --> 40:14.070
Your "Phoenix Tree Song" lingers
for three days.

40:14.176 --> 40:16.400
I won't find another like you
in the entire capital.

40:16.590 --> 40:17.960
Young Master.

40:18.510 --> 40:19.440
Did you guys hear?

40:19.760 --> 40:20.800
I heard

40:20.800 --> 40:23.710
that Cui Jinbai was having a secret
rendezvous at the riverside tavern.

40:23.840 --> 40:26.030
He was caught and fled in a panic.

40:26.080 --> 40:27.072
He jumped into the river.

40:27.190 --> 40:30.000
A secret meeting at a tavern
is no big deal.

40:30.081 --> 40:31.711
Why would he risk his life over it?

40:32.960 --> 40:34.960
That Cui Jinbai is such a phony.

40:35.070 --> 40:36.880
He acts so aloof and pure.

40:36.880 --> 40:39.070
I think people like him
are the most hypocritical.

40:39.320 --> 40:41.920
They're not as true to their nature
as you and I.

40:42.150 --> 40:44.070
He's all sanctimonious in public,

40:44.070 --> 40:44.960
but in reality,

40:44.960 --> 40:47.230
he's even wilder than we are.

40:48.440 --> 40:49.550
How interesting.

40:49.550 --> 40:51.230
Come, Hu, please.

40:51.230 --> 40:52.440
- Come on.
- Come on.

40:57.264 --> 40:58.150
What are you doing?

40:59.550 --> 41:00.630
You... What are you doing?

41:03.030 --> 41:04.710
You two were fighting in a tavern,

41:04.710 --> 41:05.630
disturbing the peace.

41:05.640 --> 41:07.110
According to the laws of our dynasty...

41:07.110 --> 41:07.920
What fight?

41:08.480 --> 41:11.280
With him? I was just
teaching him a lesson, one-sidedly.

41:11.280 --> 41:11.800
I...

41:11.800 --> 41:12.670
So you're admitting

41:12.768 --> 41:14.630
to relying on your
superior martial arts skills

41:14.630 --> 41:15.440
to bully others?

41:15.440 --> 41:16.320
He deserved it.

41:16.320 --> 41:17.230
Why did he deserve it?

41:21.360 --> 41:22.510
If you don't tell me,

41:22.510 --> 41:24.464
I can only handle this
according to the law.

41:25.480 --> 41:27.000
According to the laws of Daxing,

41:27.510 --> 41:29.400
those who provoke trouble
and engage in brawls

41:29.520 --> 41:31.230
shall receive 20 to 50 strikes
with the rod.

41:32.320 --> 41:32.880
Guards!

41:34.630 --> 41:36.230
Hu Yu, 20 strikes.

41:36.630 --> 41:37.400
Bu Shulin,

41:38.110 --> 41:39.190
50 strikes.

41:39.710 --> 41:40.360
- Wait.
- Yes.

41:42.800 --> 41:44.464
Why does he get 20 and I get 50?

41:44.496 --> 41:45.840
Because you are an imperial guard.

41:45.840 --> 41:47.968
Knowingly breaking the law
is a more severe crime.

41:52.256 --> 41:54.512
If I weren't helping you
investigate the foreign merchant,

41:54.592 --> 41:56.432
would I be hanging
around a place like that?

41:56.920 --> 41:58.030
I worked tirelessly,

41:58.030 --> 41:59.840
day and night, to find clues for you.

41:59.840 --> 42:01.824
And this is how you treat me,
Vice Minister Cui?

42:04.510 --> 42:05.230
Captain Bu,

42:05.712 --> 42:07.110
investigating a case is one thing,

42:07.880 --> 42:09.110
but you broke the law.

42:09.136 --> 42:10.550
These are two separate matters.

42:11.710 --> 42:12.630
Fine.

42:14.510 --> 42:15.710
I'll accept it.

42:16.320 --> 42:18.960
After all, I do admire
this impartiality of yours.

42:19.710 --> 42:21.440
Suffering a little for one of our own

42:21.590 --> 42:22.960
is worth it.

42:29.070 --> 42:29.800
Take them away!

42:32.480 --> 42:33.070
Let's go.

42:33.960 --> 42:34.510
Let go.

42:53.630 --> 42:55.600
You see that he's frail
and want to find a backup.

42:55.648 --> 42:56.840
You're playing both sides.

42:56.840 --> 42:58.000
Never mind playing both sides.

42:58.110 --> 43:00.710
What if I were to explore
a few more options?

43:00.710 --> 43:01.960
Among all the princes,

43:01.960 --> 43:04.070
Prince Lie is a rare military talent.

43:04.150 --> 43:06.384
I just saw that Xihe seems to admire

43:06.400 --> 43:07.510
Prince Lie quite a bit.

43:07.550 --> 43:08.760
You're from northwest.

43:08.760 --> 43:11.360
Could it be that you prefer
more masculine men?

43:16.150 --> 43:19.090
♪I've hidden so many words♪

43:19.710 --> 43:22.510
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

43:23.380 --> 43:30.350
♪So never uncover♪

43:30.540 --> 43:32.900
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

43:34.030 --> 43:36.760
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

43:37.720 --> 43:43.060
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

43:44.820 --> 43:47.640
♪Every answer I gave♪

43:48.440 --> 43:51.290
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

43:52.080 --> 43:55.450
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

43:55.710 --> 43:59.020
♪How hard it truly was?♪

44:01.990 --> 44:05.430
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

44:06.420 --> 44:08.750
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

44:10.020 --> 44:15.780
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

44:17.190 --> 44:20.320
♪It's a shame I never could♪

44:20.770 --> 44:23.780
♪Give you a moon in return♪

44:23.890 --> 44:30.530
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

44:30.530 --> 44:34.200
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

44:35.070 --> 44:37.830
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

44:38.270 --> 44:41.400
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

44:41.840 --> 44:47.790
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

44:49.190 --> 44:52.740
♪You'll never♪

44:53.020 --> 45:02.490
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪
